#
# Conformance case: common-logic/disjunction.
#
# ISO 24707 (Common Logic) example — a disjunction of two ground predications:
#   CLIF:  (or (Raining today) (Sunny today))
# "It is raining today or it is sunny today." Encoded as the canonical logic: full-FOL
# Formula AST (an Or of two unary atoms). Gates the CLIF/CGIF/XCL Exact projections:
# IR round-trip isomorphism + cross-dialect equivalence.

